    thinking: "**Verifying Prototype Integration**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating interactive experiences within the `ProjectModal.tsx` for all six projects. The goal is to determine the feasibility and best approaches for providing simulated interactions within the prototype viewer. I\'m exploring different interactive elements we can use in the `ProjectModal.tsx`.\n\n\n**Developing Interactive Elements**\n\nI\'ve been working on integrating interactive elements into the six projects within the `ProjectModal.tsx`. I\'m currently focused on the specific simulations. For \"AVO-BIO\", I\'m implementing a real-time telemetry simulator, including toggles for testing biogas load changes. For \"PANGANARA AI\", it\'s an interactive map with provincial data. The \"SIRKUL-AI\" project is receiving a slider for aeration control, while \"SIRKULAR\" gets a scanning view. \"NERACA\" is getting a time-series chart, and \"POS Resto\" has a full POS simulator.\n\n\n"
