    thinking: "**Listing Timeline Events**\n\nI\'ve begun outlining the relevant timeline items. I\'m noting the undergraduate informatics engineering student position at STT Wastukancana Purwakarta, from 2025 to the present. I\'m also including the role as Vice Chairman of Social Politics for GMNI Wastukancana Purwakarta starting from August 2026.\n\n\n**Adding Recent Achievements**\n\nI\'ve just added several recent achievements to the timeline. I have included winning 1st place in the Kilat National Essay Competition (KNEC) 2026, focusing on food and energy security with the AVO-BIO project, and being in the Top 10 of the Lomba Esai Online Nasional (LEON) 2026, focusing on Technology Applications & Engineering, organized by FORCEMI. Also, I was a volunteer in the event division for Pasundan Run 2026 (Run for Unity) in August. I also participated in the social activity \"Prevent Sexual Harassment with NOVO\" in August 2026 at SDN 2 Pasirlangu, and chaired Commission A of the Student Representative Council (MPK) at SMA Negeri 1 Bungursari.\n\n\n**Adding Social Engagement Events**\n\nI\'m now detailing participation in Pasundan Run 2026 for unity, and a social activity on preventing sexual harassment with NOVO at SDN 2 Pasirlangu, both from August 2026. I\'ve also added my role as Chair of Commission A for the Student Representative Council (MPK) at SMA Negeri 1 Bungursari.\n\n\n"
